</span><b>→</b></a><a class="portal-link" href="trusted_devices.php"><span>Trusted Devices</span><b>→</b></a><a class="portal-link" href="mfa_settings.php"><span>Two-Step Verification</span><b>→</b></a><a class="portal-link" href="security_alerts.php"><span>My Security Alerts</span><b>→</b></a><a class="portal-link" href="change_password.php"><span>Change Password</span><b>→</b></a></div></article><article class="portal-card"><h2>Quick Actions</h2><p>Use the public storefront with your secure account session.</p><div class="portal-links"><a class="portal-link" href="shop/index.php"><span>Browse Products</span><b>→</b></a><a class="portal-link" href="shop/cart.php"><span>My Cart</span><b>→</b></a><a class="portal-link" href="shop/status.php"><span>Track Request</span><b>→</b></a></div></article><article class="portal-card"><h2>Privacy Boundary</h2><p>Your account never grants access to the internal Business OS. Order tracking keys remain private and are not displayed here.</p><div class="account-list"><div class="account-row"><span>Internal Finance</span><b>Blocked</b></div><div class="account-row"><span>Staff Notes</span><b>Hidden</b></div><div class="account-row"><span>Admin Controls</span><b>Blocked</b></div></div></article><article class="portal-card full"><h2>My Recent Product Requests</h2><p>Requests are matched to the email/mobile on this Administrator-created account. A tracking key is still required on the public tracking page for detailed private progress.</p><div class="portal-table-wrap"><table class="portal-table"><thead><tr><th>Request</th><th>Date</th><th>Status</th><th>Payment</th><th>Delivery</th><th>VP</th><th>Estimated total</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($orders as $o):?><tr><td><b><?=security_step17_h($o['order_code'])?></b></td><td><?=security_step17_h($o['created_at'])?></td><td><span class="status-pill"><?=security_step17_h(customer_label((string)$o['order_status']))?></span></td><td><?=security_step17_h(customer_label((string)$o['payment_status']))?></td><td><?=security_step17_h(customer_label((string)$o['delivery_mode']))?></td><td><?=security_step17_h(rtrim(rtrim(number_format((float)$o['total_vp'],3,'.',''),'0'),'.'))?></td><td><?=customer_money($o['estimated_total'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$orders):?><tr><td colspan="7" class="empty-state">No product requests are currently matched to this account. You can still use Track Request with your private request code and key.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></article></section></main></body></html>
